{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The classic nonogram game, which has been expanding the brains of logic puzzle players for over 15 years, is finally making its way to Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pixelogic is a challenging and fun pixel logic game where you use numeric clues to uncover a hidden picture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Two new puzzles each day + a larger weekly puzzle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Unlimited access to back catalog of 6,000+ past daily puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Choose your challenge from Easy to Expert</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Know where you rank with worldwide statistics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Create and share your own puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Dark Mode and many customization options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Optimized to play with mouse &amp; keyboard or gamepad</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3677530?t=1745443412","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3677530?t=1745443412","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677530/008bbd186dd43b1a1ab789f9a4970d319ae994da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745443412","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677530/008bbd186dd43b1a1ab789f9a4970d319ae994da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745443412","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The classic nonogram game, which has been expanding the brains of logic puzzle players for over 15 years, is finally making its way to Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pixelogic is a challenging and fun pi